<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC News</title><subtitle type="html">BBC News - Technology</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/technology/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:47:59Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/technology" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/technology/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Microsoft says services fully restored after for day-long global outage</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg51rkz09o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:46:08Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T06:42:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg51rkz09o--334ebcca2306.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg51rkz09o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Efforts to address the underlying problem with Outlook, Teams and Copilot are complete, the tech firm says.</summary></entry><entry><title>Even Grand Theft Auto's original creators haven't been able to play GTA 6</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jd7k5ryl1mo#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:46:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T00:37:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jd7k5ryl1mo--f42c8666591c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6jd7k5ryl1mo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The next title in the series is expected to be the biggest video game release ever.</summary></entry><entry><title>How the Jensen Huang scandal created a headache for business-friendly Singapore</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1exevgql4qo#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:46:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T23:00:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1exevgql4qo--59d35bd98e07.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1exevgql4qo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The scandal has cast a spotlight on Singapore's success as a chip hub - and a location for alleged illicit trade.</summary></entry><entry><title>Microsoft outage 'stark reminder' of how much we rely on tech</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxzd9171m51qo#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:47:56Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T21:15:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxzd9171m51qo--d3bc368f2c82.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxzd9171m51qo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Microsoft has apologised for the issue, which it said was due to a technical failure.</summary></entry><entry><title>Pressure grows on Trump's Commerce Secretary Lutnick in fallout from Nvidia scandal</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2d1eg7zro#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T19:53:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2d1eg7zro--c19561116954.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2d1eg7zro?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Scott Bessent told CNBC that several government agencies "were in favour of putting Megaspeed on the entity list for months".</summary></entry><entry><title>Why is Microsoft's outage lasting so long and will emails be lost?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvg238zrnm5o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T18:36:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvg238zrnm5o--f83f812563eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwvg238zrnm5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Microsoft says it is continuing to restore services including Outlook and Teams following a global outage.</summary></entry><entry><title>Courts, spies and MPs: How the Microsoft outage has been felt around the world</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqp9d58eldlro#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T17:34:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqp9d58eldlro--829c82d81c0a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqp9d58eldlro?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">From city governments in the US to spy agencies in Australia, the Microsoft outage is being felt around the world.</summary></entry><entry><title>NHS, schools and police forces hit by Microsoft outage</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6vg2ljjpj32o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T13:41:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6vg2ljjpj32o--938c3e3c1998.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6vg2ljjpj32o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Major airports and intelligence services are unaffected, while the government is still assessing the impact.</summary></entry><entry><title>How a sex scandal at Nvidia is putting pressure on the White House</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c67429m3vem3o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T12:22:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c67429m3vem3o--64838ee6839b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c67429m3vem3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Jensen Huang's personal life may have triggered the crisis, but the questions now reach into the White House itself.</summary></entry><entry><title>What we know so far about the Microsoft outage</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cqzjr903n01po#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T11:43:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cqzjr903n01po--82c7a02c8237.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cqzjr903n01po?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">A Microsoft outage is affecting services including Teams, Outlook and AI software Copilot.</summary></entry><entry><title>Heat pumps: How much heat does your home really need?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqy43zk3kk04o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T09:29:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqy43zk3kk04o--691a4e74f9e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqy43zk3kk04o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Knowing how much heat your home loses is important before installing a new heating system.</summary></entry><entry><title>What happened overnight with the Microsoft global outage?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cwm2591k27e2o#0</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:45:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T07:18:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cwm2591k27e2o--cfd115ed130a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cwm2591k27e2o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Microsoft is struggling to fix a global outage, with services including Teams, Outlook and AI software Copilot affected by "connectivity problems".</summary></entry><entry><title>Ex-Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang summoned to testify before Congress about affair with alleged Chinese spy</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmq5vd1wdgz6o#0</id><updated